			"Message": "docs(Echo): Rewrite doc intros with direct \"Echo is\" voice and prune empty Todo file\n\nReplace the introductory framing in Architecture.md and DeepDive.md with a more direct declarative voice (\"Echo is...\") and update the project reference from \"Land ecosystem\" to \"Land project\" for consistency. Delete the empty Documentation/GitHub/Todo.md file that served no purpose.\n\nThese are purely cosmetic documentation improvements with no functional changes.",
