			"Message": "docs(Echo): Replace GitHub badges with concise branding header and normalize emoji spacing\n\nReplace the expansive four-badge GitHub stats table (last-commit, issues, stars, downloads) with a compact branding header displaying Echo + Land identity. Normalize emoji spacing throughout the README using `&#x2001;` (em-quad) between text and emoji characters for consistent visual alignment.\n\nAdd dedicated License, Changelog, and Project Maintainers sections. Restructure the Funding section with an HTML table header and rename to \"Funding & Acknowledgements\" for clarity. Standardize casing on `editor.land` URLs and escape Mermaid diagram label line breaks (`\\n`) for correct graph rendering.\n\nThese changes are cosmetic — no content, links, or functional metadata are altered.",
